---
title: "calculate_collateral_value (Scallop Lend: Borrowing)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_init: total_value = 0
    q_init --> q_iter: for each (coin_type, amount) in obligation.collaterals
    q_iter --> q_get_price: get oracle_price(coin_type)
    q_get_price --> q_get_weight: get collateral_weight(coin_type)
    q_get_weight --> q_calc: coin_value = amount * oracle_price * collateral_weight
    q_calc --> q_accum: total_value = total_value + coin_value
    q_accum --> q_iter: more collateral types
    q_accum --> [*]: no more types, return total_value

    note right of q_get_weight
        INV-001: 0 < collateral_weight <= 1 for all collateral pools
        INV-002: collateral_value = SUM(amount_i * price_i * weight_i) for all i
    end note

    note right of q_get_price
        INV-003: oracle_price must be fresh and non-zero
        INV-004: Changes to collateral_weight affect collateral_value for all depositors in that pool
    end note
